The simplified launcher uses ../dispatch_guide.md to dispatch workers.
Worker assignments and progress live in each task's agents/<name>_in.md and
agents/<name>_out.md; files in this directory belong to the legacy router.

The old installer generated thin Claude agent files and a generic Codex runner
from the chart now archived at ../docs/legacy/agent_trigger_matrix.md.
Keep old installations on their existing checkout; see ../docs/SIMPLE-CUTOVER.md.
